#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/chaos.adoc:216
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/skaven.adoc:305
msgid ""
"The effect lasts for the duration of the following combat phase and the "
"indicated bonus attacks are added to the unit’s total attacks each round."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/daemons.adoc:241
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/lizardmen.adoc:252
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/skaven.adoc:283
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/tomb-kings.adoc:262
msgid ""
"This spell can be cast on an enemy unit. The Wizard must be able to see his "
"target to use this spell. The spell cannot be directed at a unit engaged in "
"combat."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/kislev.adoc:264
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/skaven.adoc:271
msgid ""
"This spell can be cast upon an enemy unit that is engaged in combat and "
"which is within range. The Wizard does not have to be able to see the target "
"to cast the spell. The spell lasts for the duration of the following Combat "
"phase. Every stand in the unit, including characters that have joined the "
"unit, deducts −1 from its Attacks value."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/lizardmen.adoc:307
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/skaven.adoc:301
msgid ""
"This spell can be cast upon a friendly unit that is engaged in combat and "
"which is within range. The Wizard does not have to be able to see the target "
"to cast the spell."
msgstr ""

